{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "26a73b6f-5dc3-85fa-abcd-8a069f31aef8",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:58:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Well, almost noon. I'm calling about a storm drain. First, it's in front of my house. Second, it's slow, it grunts, you can hear it gurgling. And third, every time we get a thaw it backs up into the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gurgling and backing up on the thaw. And what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "469 Callender Avenue. North End. I rent the house, but it's the city's drain, not mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's the city's. Four sixty-nine Callender. Is it backing up right now, or is this more of a when-it-warms-up thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not right now, no. It's dry out. That is what bothers me. First, no storm. Second, no big rain. Just snow melting a little and the water sits there in the road and doesn't go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, so even without a storm it's not draining. Has it been like this a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A while, yes. I talked to the neighbor, the one across the street, and she says it happens every big rain. Every one. So it's not new, and nobody has cleaned it out, that I can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm writing that down: slow drain, standing water on thaw, neighbor says it's every heavy rain too. [pause] I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it and clear it if it's clogged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Excuse me one second. [pause] I'm making my lunch for tomorrow, I have the bread open and I'm slapping down the sandwiches here. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Do you want me to have someone call you when it's been looked at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. First, call me back when it is done. Second, tell me what they found. The number is 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seventy-two, that's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-two. And it's Mr. Teixeira?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Teixeira, yes. Diogo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, Diogo. I've got it all in. Someone will call you once the crew's been out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I will wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Enjoy the sandwiches."
    }
  ],
